msgid "実習 heat1d：熱伝導の計算"
msgstr "Practice heat1d: Heat Conduction"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`第 10 章 <edu-ch10>` で説明した 1 次元熱伝導の計算を、自分で書きます。 前の課題で書いたプログラムを、次の課題へ広げます。"
msgstr "You write the 1D heat conduction computation described in {ref}`Chapter 10 <edu-ch10>` yourself. You extend the program from the previous assignment into the next one."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`逐次版：CPU で熱伝導を解く <edu-practice-heat1d-01>`"
msgstr "{ref}`Serial version: solving heat conduction on the CPU <edu-practice-heat1d-01>`"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`MPI 版：領域を分けて解く <edu-practice-heat1d-02>`"
msgstr "{ref}`MPI version: dividing the domain <edu-practice-heat1d-02>`"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`GPU 版：配列とループを GPU へ移す <edu-practice-heat1d-03>`"
msgstr "{ref}`GPU version: moving the arrays and loops to the GPU <edu-practice-heat1d-03>`"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "式と確かめ方の考え方は第 10 章、配列と `for_each`・`reduce` は {ref}`第 7 章 <edu-ch07>`、 MPI は {ref}`第 8 章 <edu-ch08>`、GPU は {ref}`第 9 章 <edu-ch09>` を参照してください。 Ubuntu・Mac の CPU だけで、課題 1・2 と、課題 3 の CPU 用ビルドまで進められます。"
msgstr "For the ideas behind the equations and the checks, see Chapter 10; for arrays, `for_each`, and `reduce`, see {ref}`Chapter 7 <edu-ch07>`; for MPI, see {ref}`Chapter 8 <edu-ch08>`; and for the GPU, see {ref}`Chapter 9 <edu-ch09>`. With only the CPU on Ubuntu or Mac, you can work through Assignments 1 and 2, and the CPU build of Assignment 3."

msgid "共通の設定"
msgstr "Common setup"

msgid "3 つの課題で、次の問題と入力を使います。"
msgstr "The three assignments use the following problem and inputs."

msgid "項目"
msgstr "Item"

msgid "値"
msgstr "Value"

msgid "方程式"
msgstr "Equation"

msgid "$\\partial u/\\partial t = \\kappa\\,\\partial^2 u/\\partial x^2$、$\\kappa = 1$"
msgstr ""

msgid "領域と境界条件"
msgstr "Domain and boundary conditions"

msgid "$0 < x < 1$、両端で $u = 0$"
msgstr "$0 < x < 1$, $u = 0$ at both ends"

msgid "初期条件"
msgstr "Initial condition"

msgid "$u(x, 0) = \\sin(\\pi x)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "解析解"
msgstr "Analytical solution"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$u(x, t) = e^{-\\pi^2\\kappa t}\\sin(\\pi x)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "終了時刻"
msgstr "End time"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$t_\\mathrm{end} = 0.1$"
msgstr ""

msgid "格子"
msgstr "Grid"

msgid "セル数 $N$（既定 64）、$\\Delta x = 1/N$、セル中心 $x_j = (j + 1/2)\\Delta x$"
msgstr "Number of cells $N$ (default 64), $\\Delta x = 1/N$, cell centers $x_j = (j + 1/2)\\Delta x$"

msgid "ゴーストセル"
msgstr "Ghost cells"

msgid "両端に 1 つずつ（配列の大きさは物理セル数 + 2）"
msgstr "One at each end (the array size is the number of physical cells + 2)"

msgid "時間刻み"
msgstr "Time step"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$n_\\mathrm{steps} = \\lceil t_\\mathrm{end}/(r_\\mathrm{max}\\Delta x^2/\\kappa)\\rceil$、$\\Delta t = t_\\mathrm{end}/n_\\mathrm{steps}$、$r_\\mathrm{max}$ の既定は 0.4"
msgstr "$n_\\mathrm{steps} = \\lceil t_\\mathrm{end}/(r_\\mathrm{max}\\Delta x^2/\\kappa)\\rceil$, $\\Delta t = t_\\mathrm{end}/n_\\mathrm{steps}$, default $r_\\mathrm{max}$ is 0.4"

msgid "値の型"
msgstr "Value type"

msgid "`using Real = double;`"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "プログラムは、コマンドライン引数で $N$ と $r_\\mathrm{max}$ を受け取れるようにします（省略したら 64 と 0.4）。 `main(int argc, char **argv)` の `argv[1]` を `std::atoi`、`argv[2]` を `std::atof`（`<cstdlib>`）で数に直します。"
msgstr "Make the program accept $N$ and $r_\\mathrm{max}$ as command-line arguments (defaulting to 64 and 0.4 if omitted). Convert `argv[1]` of `main(int argc, char **argv)` to a number with `std::atoi`, and `argv[2]` with `std::atof` (`<cstdlib>`)."

msgid "各課題のプログラムは、最後に次を表示します。"
msgstr "At the end, the program of each assignment prints the following."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "`max error (discrete)` は離散解 $G^{n}\\sin(\\pi x_j)$（$G = 1 - 4r\\sin^2(\\pi\\Delta x/2)$）との、 `max error (exact)` は解析解との、全物理セルでの最大の差です。"
msgstr "`max error (discrete)` is the maximum difference over all physical cells from the discrete solution $G^{n}\\sin(\\pi x_j)$ ($G = 1 - 4r\\sin^2(\\pi\\Delta x/2)$), and `max error (exact)` is the maximum difference from the analytical solution."

msgid "さらに、全物理セルの $x_j$ と $u_j$ を 1 行に 1 セルずつ、空白で区切ってファイルに書き出します。 ファイルどうしをビット単位で比べるため、17 桁で書きます。 `std::ofstream`（`<fstream>`）に `std::scientific` と `std::setprecision(17)`（`<iomanip>`）を指定すると、`1.23456789012345678e-01` の形で書けます。"
msgstr "In addition, write $x_j$ and $u_j$ of all physical cells to a file, one cell per line, separated by a space. To compare files bit by bit, write them with 17 digits. If you set `std::scientific` and `std::setprecision(17)` (`<iomanip>`) on a `std::ofstream` (`<fstream>`), it writes in the form `1.23456789012345678e-01`."

msgid "ビルドの設定"
msgstr "Build setup"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`第 1 章 <edu-ch01>` の「自分のプログラムから MISO を使う最小の CMake 設定」を使います。 作業用のフォルダ（たとえば `heat1d/`）に `CMakeLists.txt` とソースを置き、MISO の場所を `-DMISO_DIR=/path/to/MISO` で渡します。"
msgstr "Use the \"minimal CMake configuration for using MISO from your own program\" in {ref}`Chapter 1 <edu-ch01>`. Put `CMakeLists.txt` and the sources in a working folder (for example `heat1d/`), and pass the location of MISO with `-DMISO_DIR=/path/to/MISO`."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "実行ファイルは課題ごとに 1 つずつ（`heat1d_serial`、`heat1d_mpi`、`heat1d_gpu`）作り、それぞれ `MISO::MISO` をリンクします。 MISO を `add_subdirectory` で取り込むと MPI と yaml-cpp も一緒にリンクされるので、MPI のための設定を別に足す必要はありません。 GPU 用のビルドに必要な追加の設定は {ref}`課題 3 <edu-practice-heat1d-03>` で説明します。"
msgstr "Build one executable per assignment (`heat1d_serial`, `heat1d_mpi`, `heat1d_gpu`), and link each to `MISO::MISO`. When you bring in MISO with `add_subdirectory`, MPI and yaml-cpp are linked together with it, so you do not need to add any separate configuration for MPI. The extra settings needed for the GPU build are explained in {ref}`Assignment 3 <edu-practice-heat1d-03>`."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "MPI のプログラムは `mpiexec -np 2 ./build/heat1d_mpi` のように実行します。 コンテナの中などで OpenMPI がエラーを出すときは、{ref}`第 8 章 <edu-ch08>` で説明した環境変数（`demo/shared/openmpi_config.env`）を設定します。"
msgstr "Run the MPI program like `mpiexec -np 2 ./build/heat1d_mpi`. If OpenMPI reports errors, for example inside a container, set the environment variables described in {ref}`Chapter 8 <edu-ch08>` (`demo/shared/openmpi_config.env`)."

msgid "記録すること"
msgstr "What to record"

msgid "各課題で、次を記録しておくと、後の課題で比べられます。"
msgstr "For each assignment, record the following so that you can compare them in later assignments."

msgid "$N$ ごとの `max error (exact)` と、そこから求めた収束次数"
msgstr "`max error (exact)` for each $N$, and the order of convergence computed from it"

msgid "`max error (discrete)` の大きさ"
msgstr "The size of `max error (discrete)`"

msgid "書き出したファイル（逐次版の結果は、MPI 版・GPU 版と比べるときに使います）"
msgstr "The files you wrote (use the results of the serial version when comparing with the MPI and GPU versions)"

